# Infra Gate Kit — destructive command patterns
# One grep -E pattern per line. Lines starting with # are comments.
#
# Deliberately EMPTY, not the upstream kit's cloud-tooling defaults
# (Terraform/GCP/AWS/Azure/k8s/DB-migration/Docker patterns) — this project
# is a static HTML app + a Capacitor iOS shell with zero cloud infrastructure,
# zero Terraform, zero cloud CLI usage, and zero DB migrations. Copying those
# patterns in verbatim would be dead weight that never matches anything and
# creates false confidence that "infra is gated" for a project with no infra
# to gate. If this project ever grows real infra tooling (a deploy pipeline,
# a cloud backend, a database), add the matching pattern here THEN.
